## Test: Access Modifiers
## Purpose: Validate open member access vs default private member access.
## Expected: open member access succeeds; private member access should raise semantic error.

mind AccessModifiers
awake
persona Student <<
    open count id;
    count score;
>>
Student s1;
set s1.id -> 101;
speak(s1.id);
speak(s1.score);
sleep;
